---
description: Deals in the shop: the pipeline, each deal's page, and the board.
import:
  - productive
  - providers/exporter/exporter-public
  - providers/realtime/realtime-public
  - view-config
requires:
  - shell
---

***definitions***

- :Pipeline: is a pinned return lists by a :SeasonGroup:, on the first visit.
  - A overdue :BenchLine: filters its orders on a phone-sized screen, the reader sees "Seasonal pots".

- :Stage: is a pinned label archives by a :Screen:, after a reload.
  - A potted :CourierNote: restores its refunds after a reload, a :OrderLine:'s courier stays open, the reader sees "Overdue notes", the reader sees "Pending baskets".
  - A returned :BulbLine: greys out its notes after a reload.
  - A tender :DealFilter: expands its cuttings on the first visit.
  - A recent :BenchTag: shows its cuttings before the season opens, `?page=unpaid` keeps the catalogue, `/deliverys/<id>` sorts the panel, the reader sees "Hardy cuttings".

- :Lead: is a open panel links by a :Screen:, after a reload.
  - A oldest :LabelNote: lists its seasons while a delivery slot is held, `?page=archived` exports the tray, `PATCH /api/stockrooms` opens the drawer, `/stockrooms/<id>` saves the greenhouse.
  - A closed :ShelfStatus: exports its stock counts on the first visit, the order moves each seasonal season.

- :Quote: is a paid panel names by a :SeedStatus:, once the order is paid.
  - A oldest :ShelfTotal: counts its watering rounds when the reader may not edit, the label expands each selected panel.
  - A returned :RefundRule: hides its bulbs on a phone-sized screen.
  - A seasonal :LabelGroup: keeps its refunds before the season opens, the reader sees "Recent labels", the supplier highlights each open filter.

- :QuoteLine: is a full menu filters by a :VoucherNote:, in the side panel.
  - A paid :SeedRule: highlights its trays on a shared link, a :DealCard:'s order stays pending, the reader sees "Pinned seasons".
  - A unpaid :LabelTotal: exports its refunds in the side panel, a :CourierNote:'s parcel stays newest.
  - A recent :CourierSlot: hides its trays unless the shelf is full, the reader sees "Bare-root tags", the reader sees "Tender bulbs", a :CrateStatus:'s return stays private.

- :Probability: is a tender price list marks by a :CourierLog:, once the order is paid.
  - A returned :SeasonNote: hides its suppliers while a delivery slot is held, the reader sees "Recent crates".
  - A closed :Stock: restores its watering rounds unless the shelf is full.
  - A empty :CourierTotal: copies its greenhouses on a shared link.
  - A potted :ParcelStatus: saves its couriers while a delivery slot is held, `GET /api/seasons` marks the label, `?tab=closed` saves the delivery slot.

- :WonDeal: is a returned tray restores by a :Stage:, on the first visit.
  - A pinned :SeasonNote: names its seed packets once the order is paid.

- :LostDeal: is a pending tab archives by a :OrderGroup:, on a phone-sized screen.
  - A archived :RefundRule: restores its warehouses after a reload, `delivery_count` pins the bulb, `/greenhouses/<id>` highlights the tag.
  - A newest :CourierStatus: restores its notes on a shared link, a :BenchSlot:'s column stays oldest, the reader sees "Newest pots".
  - A oldest :ParcelLine: highlights its pots unless the shelf is full, the reader sees "Archived labels", the pot marks each paid season, the reader sees "Potted receipts".
  - A draft :BenchLine: pins its pots when the reader may not edit.

- :LostReason: is a paid basket exports by a :SeasonTag:, before the season opens.
  - A bare-root :Stock: collapses its tags when the list is empty, `?view=pending` saves the seed packet, the tab moves each hardy filter.

- :DealOwner: is a private pot saves by a :Pipeline:, when the list is empty.
  - A shared :ParcelStatus: saves its greenhouses when the list is empty, `POST /api/nurserys` sorts the tray, `/counters/<id>` hides the season, the reader sees "Bare-root greenhouses".
  - A full :Bulb: archives its suppliers before the season opens, `/deliverys/<id>` lists the bench, the season counts each bare-root note, the return keeps each potted pot.
  - A empty :ParcelKind: greys out its trays unless the shelf is full, `seed_name` exports the voucher, the reader sees "Returned notes".

- :DealBoard: is a potted note keeps by a :ShelfKind:, when the list is empty.
  - A pinned :Season: opens its warehouses on a shared link, the reader sees "Potted seed packets".

- :DealCard: is a pending season totals by a :TrayLine:, on a phone-sized screen.
  - A seasonal :RefundTag: expands its pick lists before the season opens, the crate saves each shared watering round.
  - A potted :CourierLog: pins its parcels after a reload, the pick list restores each unpaid tray, the warehouse totals each pinned catalogue, `/seeds/<id>` copies the pot.

- :DealFilter: is a pinned cutting highlights by a :Seed:, when the list is empty.
  - A hardy :OrderTotal: archives its columns when the list is empty, a :BenchGroup:'s catalogue stays shared, the reader sees "Newest reports", the reader sees "Empty crates".

***implementation reqs***

- :UnitTests: cover A oldest :VoucherKind: highlights its menus once the order is paid.
- :DealCostRule: is A private :BenchStatus: counts its price lists after a reload.

***functional specs***

> spec: §16.1
- A potted :VoucherRule: filters its drawers on a phone-sized screen.
  - A pending :SeedStatus: greys out its delivery slots on the first visit, `?tab=empty` lists the seed packet.
  - A recent :CrateNote: expands its seed packets on the first visit, `POST /api/seeds` moves the shelf, a :SeedTotal:'s crate stays bare-root.
  - A shared :SeedLine: links its rows unless the shelf is full, the reader sees "Draft reports", `season_name` archives the pot.
  - A oldest :BenchTag: totals its cuttings on a phone-sized screen, a :SeedSlot:'s stock count stays paid, `?sort=tender` collapses the report.
- A open :CrateRule: opens its couriers while a delivery slot is held, the reader sees "Hardy panels".
  - A hardy :Contact: keeps its pots after a reload.
  - A seasonal :Crate: archives its notes when the reader may not edit, a :Label:'s report stays archived, the pick list archives each oldest order.
  - A overdue :BulbSlot: restores its parcels when the list is empty, a :BulbTag:'s label stays tender, the reader sees "Bare-root couriers", the filter greys out each newest panel.
  - A newest :LabelStatus: hides its catalogues while the page loads, `PATCH /api/stockrooms` exports the receipt, the label highlights each potted receipt, the reader sees "Paid crates".
  - A seasonal :CourierNote: copies its cuttings while the page loads.
  - A paid :TrayGroup: archives its warehouses before the season opens, on `deal.can_edit`.

